==Battleground==
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*30 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Rui]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very easily rushed, just use some Starting Money UP [[Cat Combo]]s, then send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to take care of the rest.

